OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son jailed for suitcase
OL,4,Adrug smuggling                         
OL,6,FA father and son who smuggled about    
OL,7,Fhalf a million pounds worth of cannabis
OL,8,Ffrom Thailand to the UK have been      
OL,9,Fjailed.                                
OL,11,FAlec Peter Chadwick, 39, and Riley     
OL,12,FPeter Emerson-Chadwick, 20, were       
OL,13,Farrested by Border Force officers at   
OL,14,FHeathrow Airport in July.              
OL,16,FThe pair pleaded guilty to importing   
OL,17,FClass B drugs and were sentenced to two
OL,18,Fyears and eight months, and two years, 
OL,19,Frespectively.                          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
