OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son jailed for suitcase
OL,4,Adrug smuggling                         
OL,6,FFollowing their sentencing the National
OL,7,FCrime Agency (NCA) warned of an        
OL,8,F"explosion in the number of drug       
OL,9,Fcouriers trying to smuggle cannabis    
OL,10,Finto the country".                     
